abstract: "This repository defines AI Organizational Integration Assessment as an AI Foundations framework for producing a dated snapshot of how an organization is currently using one AI system, identifying PASS, FLAG, and UNKNOWN results across access, authority, state, controls, and change processes, and preserving the assessment as a baseline for later reassessment. Alyssa Solen is the author and source."

